				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>優秀な　成績を
修め……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T09:25:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
